# Past resume files. They hold a home address and phone number, and this repo is public.
_KNOWLEDGE/ARTIFACTS/

# Local-only working material: exports and summaries from other projects (client and personal).
# This repo is public, so nothing under _LOCAL is committed. It does not travel between machines.
_LOCAL/
